<gpx version="1.1" creator="Good Shit" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><trk><name>Stevns Klint Trampesti — Rødvig–Bøgeskov full Trampesti</name><desc>Walk the full cliff-top Trampesti north from Rødvig harbour through Boesdal, Stevnsfort, Højerup and Stevns Fyr, then continue via Mandehoved and Holtug quarry to Bøgeskov harbour. Plan onward transport from the northern end.

